# Frontend Rules

- Path alias: `@/` → `src/`
- New pages: lazy-load in `App.tsx`, wrap with `ProtectedRoute`
- Admin pages: `ProtectedRoute requireAdmin`
- No direct Supabase queries in components — use `src/services/database.ts`
- API calls: `src/services/grokApi.ts`, `carouselApi.ts`, or `utils/apiFetch.ts`
- Types: add to `src/types/index.ts` before using in services/components
- Styling: Tailwind utilities, brand color `primary-600` (#0284c7), Lucide icons
- Forms per product type: `*Form.tsx` in `src/components/`
- User-facing changelog: `src/data/changelog.ts` (non-technical, bilingual)
